 "name_en": "Convergent Invoicing – Cost Handling for Subscriptions and Usage (6WD)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Convergent Invoicing – Cost Handling for Subscriptions and Usage (6WD)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiod3fffce4081a482ea4901cddca585624\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod3fffce4081a482ea4901cddca585624__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item allows the posting of costs as well as cost recognition for fulfillment costs.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">In invoicing, the cost of sales can be posted as an expense to financial accounting, and G/L items are automatically created. This posting to expense accounts can be done synchronously with sales revenue posting during bill creation. Depending on the type of costs, composite cost amounts can be determined and posted to different expense accounts.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod3fffce4081a482ea4901cddca585624__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Rating in external system or Convergent Invoicing creates billable items for usage with billable item cost type.</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">During transfer of usage billable item, cost items are created automatically</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Invoicing in Convergent Invoicing creates Invoice for revenue and expense postings, using standard G/L posting in invoicing</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod3fffce4081a482ea4901cddca585624__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Improve visibility and accuracy in controlling and profitability analysis</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Enhance cost controlling for digital services, including those involving third-party and partner-based services</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Support legal compliance to forecast and update the costs of fulfillments</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Convergent Invoicing – 订阅和使用的成本处理 (6WD)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiod3fffce4081a482ea4901cddca585624\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod3fffce4081a482ea4901cddca585624__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目允许过账成本以及执行成本的成本确认。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">在开发票中，销售成本可以作为费用过账到财务会计，并自动创建总账项目。在账单创建期间，可以同步完成对费用科目的过账与销售收入过账。根据成本类型，可以确定复合成本金额并将其过账到不同的费用科目。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod3fffce4081a482ea4901cddca585624__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">在外部系统中定价或 Convergent Invoicing 中创建可开票项目，用于可开票项目成本类型。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在使用可开票项目的传输期间，会自动创建成本项目</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Convergent Invoicing 中的开发票使用开发票中的标准总账过账为收入和费用过账创建发票</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod3fffce4081a482ea4901cddca585624__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">提高控制和获利能力分析的可视性和准确性</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">加强数字化服务的成本控制，包括涉及第三方服务和合作伙伴服务的服务</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">支持法律合规性，以预测和更新执行成本</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
